null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"Muzak: Música para ser ignorada","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7iN6WiB5Y1g"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Ridicule of Academic Virtuosity","body":"Erik Satie was known for ridiculing academic virtuosity in music. His compositions included absurd performance instructions such as \"play with elegant indifference,\" which reflected his rejection of traditional musical seriousness and pretension. \"Erick Satir rediculizó el virtuosismo académico y escribía parte de las conestrucciones absurdas como, toquece con una indiferencia elegante.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"El punk existía antes de Sex Pistols (y era algo salvaje)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ilXpBujkWZE"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":63299243334140,"type":"album","name":"Piano Music of Erik Satie, Vol.1","list_id":217195108821131,"list":"RYM Top — Classical Music — Impressionism","src":"musthear","rank":8,"year":1968,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":251319020060387,"type":"album","name":"Early Pianoworks, Volume One","list_id":217195108821131,"list":"RYM Top — Classical Music — Impressionism","src":"musthear","rank":2,"year":1975,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":835639606589,"type":"album","name":"Mélodies; Hymne; Poèmes d'amour; Ludions","list_id":40452930987258,"list":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Mélodie","src":"musthear","rank":53,"year":1976,"note":null,"yt":"31rt_S8NBgY","scaruffi":null},{"id":141580199478923,"type":"album","name":"3 Gymnopédies & Other Piano Works","list_id":217195108821131,"list":"RYM Top — Classical Music — Impressionism","src":"musthear","rank":4,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":4234490263905,"type":"album","name":"Œuvres d'Erik Satie","list_id":217195108821131,"list":"RYM Top — Classical Music — Impressionism","src":"musthear","rank":17,"year":1986,"note":null,"yt":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":25458